 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"I can't reach this properly. Could you clean it out for me? Please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"It's getting worse, not better. If it festers I'm no good to anyone — can't haul, can't hunt, can't watch. Just clean it out and wrap it tight.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"We went over this,\" Enzo says, a little tired. \"I already told you the truth about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Their voice loosens. The guardedness thins."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Right. I get it.\" A beat — and then the subject is closed. They won't raise it again."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Still on that favor.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Forget I asked. I'll figure it out.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Don't mind me. Today's just heavy, friend.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "It's quiet at the tree line. Ingrid doesn't say much. Sometimes that's the whole point."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"What's this about? You're kind. Don't let this place change that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Minh owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Minh said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"The fire feels smaller without Minh. The rest of us will have to be bigger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "You show them Wood Sorrel — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Maybe it's only me — Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Rest when you can. We'll talk again soon.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Thanks for... you know. Just listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Has this changed you? Like, fundamentally?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"I mean this — The old you got you here. The new you keeps you here. Both count.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Still on how this changed you. No time to waste.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Minh always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"I count portions out loud before eating. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "You show them Wood Sorrel — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Good — that favor, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about what's been happening — we left it mid-thought, 3 days back. 'You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Come get air with me. I need to think out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "You walk to the ridge with Ingrid. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"I greet everyone by name each morning for Minh, now. Feels right. Feels like the least I can do.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"If I may — Still on what's been happening. That's still where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "You show them Ghost Pipe — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Go on, then. I'll be thinking good thoughts at you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"About that question — Are you angry? At whoever did this. At the sky. At anything. That matters to me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Good. Anger's fuel. Just — point it somewhere useful. That's the whole of it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Here's the thing: Still on whether you're angry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Since Lena died... I keep expecting to see Lena at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"I count portions out loud before eating for Lena, now. Feels right. Feels like the least I can do.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "You show them Wild Ginger — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "A warmth settles over the conversation — they lean in a little."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Every laugh out there feels wrong today. Then I feel wrong for thinking it. Good talking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "They shake their head, then nod — both true at once. \"Talk to me a bit. That helps more than anything.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Lena owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"I wish there was more to tell. That's it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"You're family now. Chosen family — the kind that actually counts.\" \"That's where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Still on each other. You know?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "You show them Wild Ginger — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Thanks for... you know. Just listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"I tried the Wild Ginger like you showed me. Didn't poison anyone, so that's a win.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Come get air with me. I need to think out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "You walk to the ridge with Enzo. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Still on that plant lesson.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"When's the last time you really laughed?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"This wound — I can't clean it properly one-handed. Could you take a look?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"It's getting worse, not better. If it festers I'm no good to anyone — can't haul, can't hunt, can't watch. Just clean it out and wrap it tight.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"You saw it too, right? Hollow Belly. Tell me I didn't imagine the lights.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"I sit apart to eat. It passes the time. The time passes anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "You show them Ghost Pipe — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Alright, duty calls. This was a good pause.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  }
 ],
